{"title":"King Noble Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"71\" data-start=\"0\" data-section-id=\"1s5mkr9\"\u003eDiscover the Refined Beauty of King Noble Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"814\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Noble collection brings a refined and designer-inspired approach to holiday decorating. Inspired by the natural structure of real Noble Fir trees, these artificial Christmas trees feature intentionally airy branch spacing, layered foliage, and a sculptural silhouette that creates depth, dimension, and understated elegance throughout your space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"814\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Noble collection offers a beautifully curated holiday look whether you prefer timeless evergreen charm or a cozy winter-inspired aesthetic. The King Noble Fir showcases rich green foliage with a natural, minimalist feel, while the King Noble Flock features professionally applied flocking that mimics the appearance of freshly fallen snow.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"981\" data-start=\"814\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eCrafted with a blend of classic and realistic tips, each tree is thoughtfully designed to balance texture, structure, and durability while maintaining its signature open and airy appearance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eShould I choose the King Noble Fir or the King Noble Flock?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eBoth trees share the same signature Noble Fir silhouette and open branch structure. The difference comes down to finish and the overall mood you want to create in your space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Noble Fir features rich, deep green foliage that captures the natural look of a real Christmas tree. It is a timeless, versatile choice that works beautifully across a wide range of holiday decorating styles, from classic and traditional to modern and minimalist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Noble Flock features the same elegant structure finished with professionally applied white flocking that mimics the appearance of freshly fallen snow. It is ideal for those looking to create a wintry, sophisticated atmosphere and its white finish pairs especially well with cool metallics, neutral palettes, and warm candlelight tones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the King Noble supposed to look sparse?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eYes! That is exactly what makes it special. The King Noble's open, airy branch spacing is an intentional design choice, not a limitation. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eRather than hiding ornaments within dense foliage, the King Noble lets every decoration breathe and be seen. Each ornament, ribbon loop, and light strand becomes part of a composed, intentional display, which is why this tree is a favorite among designers or those love the 'Charlie Brown' inspired Christmas. \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThe King Noble has earned its place as a King of Christmas bestseller year after year, beloved for its distinctive look, styling versatility, and easy setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhy is the King Noble so popular?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eUnlike traditional \u003ca title=\"Full Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/full-artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003efull artificial Christmas trees\u003c\/a\u003e, the King Noble is designed with a naturally spaced branch structure inspired by real Noble Fir trees. Its layered silhouette creates a lighter, more architectural appearance that feels elevated, modern, and intentionally styled.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eThis airy design allows ornaments, ribbon, and lighting to stand out beautifully, making the King Noble especially popular for minimalist, curated, and designer-inspired holiday décor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eHow do you decorate the King Noble?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe King Noble was made for those who love a minimalistic holiday approach. Its open branch structure and sculptural silhouette pair beautifully with simple and curated holiday styles. Think thoughtfully placed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e, elegant \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e, and warm white lighting. \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/picks\" title=\"All Decorative Picks\"\u003eTree picks\u003c\/a\u003e are also a beautiful way to add layers of texture and fullness to the King Noble's open branches, as they can be tucked throughout the tree and fill the silhouette naturally to add depth without overpowering the elegant, airy structure. It also works strikingly well with modern, Scandinavian-inspired, and nature inspired aesthetics.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the King Noble Fir available pre-lit or unlit?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe King Noble collection is available in both pre-lit and unlit options to accommodate your decorating preferences.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eOur pre-lit King Noble artificial Christmas trees feature professionally installed lighting that glows beautifully through the tree's open branch structure, creating a warm and luminous effect that is truly stunning. With Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless — no tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect, and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eIs the King Noble easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eYes. The King Noble is designed for straightforward setup, easy storage, and reliable long-term use. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly, and its open structure means less time spent fluffing and shaping compared to denser tree styles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand and complimentary setup gloves to assist during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhen the season ends, the King Noble disassembles easily and stores neatly in a cool, dry place, preserving its foliage, structure, and overall condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eExplore the King Noble collection to discover beautifully crafted artificial Christmas trees designed to bring texture, warmth, and sophisticated holiday beauty into your home season after season.\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"6' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642909847616,"sku":"KNF-T6-U","price":199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_6ef8cc7c-2ec1-4b6c-bb8f-11a658704624.jpg?v=1718158207"},{"product_id":"6-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"6' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 450 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642909945920,"sku":"KNF-T6-L","price":429.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-v1_169f3774-d549-4ff3-a309-d3be5e3bcb60.png?v=1714672821"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642910044224,"sku":"KNF-T7-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3.jpg?v=1718158508"},{"product_id":"7-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-led","title":"7' King Noble Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7' \/ Green \/ LED","offer_id":28642910208064,"sku":"KNF-T7-L","price":549.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Noble-Fir-led.png?v=1779243007"},{"product_id":"8-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"8' King Noble Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the unique beauty of the King Noble, a true masterpiece that perfectly replicates the sparse silhouette of the classic Noble Fir.Each branch is expertly crafted to ensure a lifelike look that offers the perfect backdrop for your cherished ornaments. Ideal as a centerpiece or secondary tree, it shines wherever it’s displayed.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Green \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642910404672,"sku":"KNF-T8-U","price":379.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-3_9f3b6f